                                "sense_id": "a3767dd0-9dc1-3425-9263-754308ac815b",
                                "text": "It is therefore important to decate only very slightly."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "deec382c-4eab-433d-8c8d-a07af9486e13",
                                "sense_id": "a3767dd0-9dc1-3425-9263-754308ac815b",
                                "text": "The Commanding General wished to know whether cloth going into storage should ever be decated. The opinion of the technologist was that , if the cloth was decated in the presence of DDT, the mothicide would steam-distill out[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2fd98aee-2d46-440a-98c3-bc8506d319f8",
                                "sense_id": "a3767dd0-9dc1-3425-9263-754308ac815b",
                                "text": "Next it will be […] neatly rolled, and finally pressed or decated (pressed with steam). Each of these processes requires several hours and specific equipment."
                            }
                        ]
